^{:go/end 200} (go/method Write "Write appends the contents of p to the buffer, growing the buffer as\nneeded. The return value n is the length of p; err is always nil. If the\nbuffer becomes too large, Write will panic with [ErrTooLarge].\n" [^{:tag (* Buffer)} b ^{:tag (slice byte)} p] :results [^int n ^error err]
